1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
5 signs you're mentally exhausted
that nobody talks about

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Number one.
You're tired no matter how much you sleep.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:10,000
Eight hours, nine hours, still exhausted.
That's not laziness.
That's your mind running on empty.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Number two.
Small decisions feel impossible.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
What to eat. What to wear. What to reply.
When your brain is burnt out,
even tiny choices feel overwhelming.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Number three.
You've stopped enjoying things you used to love.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Not sad exactly. Just numb.
That's emotional exhaustion, not depression.
There's a difference.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Number four.
You're irritable for no reason.

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Snapping at people who don't deserve it.
Feeling on edge constantly.
Your nervous system is overloaded.

10
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Number five.
You keep saying you're fine.

11
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
But you're not fine.
You're just tired of explaining it.

12
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,500
If any of these hit —
your mind needs attention, not just rest.

13
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:49,000
Start small. Check in with yourself daily.
Even five minutes of journaling
changes things more than you'd think.

14
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,000
Nesra is a free app
that helps you do exactly that.
Link in bio.
